<metadata><name>Snowlands 1013 Foster Meadow Loop</name><desc>lollipop (loop from waypoint 3, stem retraced). 3.5 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1013_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
